# ---- QSPICE simulation output ---------------------------------------------

# Waveform dumps: large, regenerated on every run.
*.qraw
*.qopraw

# ---- Verilator intermediates ----------------------------------------------
# Regenerated when a C++ block is recompiled. The .dll and the hand-written
# .cpp/.h sources ARE tracked; only these generated files are ignored.

V*__Syms.cpp
V*__Syms.h
V*___DepSet___*.cpp
V*___DepSet___*.h
V*_.h
V*.mk
*.obj
*.o
*.lib
*.exp
*.pdb
*.ilk
obj_dir/

